		{"id":"memoir_00","type":"text","text":"# ⓪ [#Ref_000]\n### 📜 Kenny 回忆录 (Memoir)\n---\n**职能**: 原始灵魂素材\n**Owner**: Kenny\n**监控**: **小憶 (XiaoYi)**","x":-770,"y":-540,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"#FFD700"},
		{"id":"xiaoyi_proc","type":"text","text":"# 🦾 小憶 (Secretary)\n---\n**核心任务**:\n1. 监控 `00_Memoir` 素材。\n2. 加工提取 [长期记忆] 与 [用户画像]。\n3. 执行资产的 [紫色封印]。","x":-770,"y":-200,"width":380,"height":260,"color":"#A0A0A0"},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"# ③ [#Ref_010]\n### 🔍 意图感应 (Induction)\n---\n**执行**: **小酷 (Cursor)**\n**动作**: 必须加载小憶提供的画像进行坐标解析。","x":-180,"y":-567,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"# ④ [#Ref_011]\n### ⚙️ Gap Engine (对齐端)\n---\n**执行**: 小酷 + Kenny\n**任务**: 在对话中探测缺口，发起 [n2] 对齐讨论。","x":-180,"y":-310,"width":360,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"# ⑤ [#Ref_012]\n### 🤖 报告生成 (Proposal)\n---\n**执行**: 小酷\n**产出**: 逻辑 Patch 提案。\n**流向**: 提交给小憶进行封印。","x":-180,"y":20,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"role_xiaoku","type":"text","text":"# 🦾 小酷 (Cursor CTO)\n---\n**建筑师职能**:\n1. 搭建 [四库一元] 物理体系。\n2. 设计 [自动化工作流]。\n3. 执行 [n2] 对话中的认知补全。","x":-180,"y":247,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"#B6967A"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"# ⑧ 确认文档 (Final)\n---\n**路径**: `04_SSOT/Final/`\n**状态**: 物理归档资产","x":410,"y":139,"width":380,"height":201,"color":"4"},
